    <string name="plant_help">How does it work?</string>
    <string name="plant_help_title">How the plant works</string>
    <string name="plant_help_body">• Each completed pomodoro: +5 health and counts toward growth.\n• Stages: Seed → Sprout (5) → Young (15) → In bloom (40) → Tree (100 pomodoros).\n• Watering: +10 health, once per day.\n• If a full day passes without completing any pomodoro: −15 health (wither).\n• The stage never decreases; health bottoms at 0 and can recover to 100 with care.\n• Wither is checked when you open the app or finish a pomodoro.</string>

